# Compatibility projection; Twin blueprint conformance remains authoritative.

LIFECYCLE twin-stage VERSION 1
DESCRIPTION "Digital Twin stage blueprint with controlled evidence-backed evolution"
STATE CONCEPT INITIAL
STATES [MODELED, VALIDATED, RELEASED, OPERATING, EVOLVING]
STATE RETIRED TERMINAL
EVENTS [MODEL, VALIDATE, RELEASE, OPERATE, EVOLVE, STABILIZE, RETIRE]
EVIDENCES [MODEL_EVIDENCE, VALIDATION_EVIDENCE, RELEASE_APPROVAL, OPERATION_EVIDENCE, CHANGE_APPROVAL, STABILIZATION_EVIDENCE, RETIREMENT_APPROVAL]
TRANSITION CONCEPT -> MODELED ON MODEL REQUIRES MODEL_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION MODELED -> VALIDATED ON VALIDATE REQUIRES VALIDATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION VALIDATED -> RELEASED ON RELEASE REQUIRES RELEASE_APPROVAL
TRANSITION RELEASED -> OPERATING ON OPERATE REQUIRES OPERATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION OPERATING -> EVOLVING ON EVOLVE REQUIRES CHANGE_APPROVAL
TRANSITION EVOLVING -> OPERATING ON STABILIZE REQUIRES STABILIZATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION OPERATING -> RETIRED ON RETIRE REQUIRES RETIREMENT_APPROVAL
END
